(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=-3$ and ${x}_{3}=1,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =5(x-(-3))(x-(-3))(x-1) \\\\  & =5(x+3)(x+3)(x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(x+3)(x+3)(x-1) & =5({x}^{2}+6x+9)(x-1) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+6{x}^{2}-6x+9x-9) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}+5{x}^{2}+3x-9) \\\\  & =5{x}^{3}+25{x}^{2}+15x-45.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=5{x}^{3}+25{x}^{2}+15x-45.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104471/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104471"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107540/selection/ab33e84062a6d012a651b627cc5dac74d3841a5aa5fd54aeeac6870510e70836" :answer/id #uuid "94b67589-28b7-58bd-989a-b361536a8da2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-30x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107540/selection/219495f2c974d81cf8067b3ece36f8f58398fbe7bc54e621a741e706b5f35970" :answer/id #uuid "a9aa6391-e74c-5e7d-b32f-4bbc6369d2a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107540/selection/4340acf237de303124c2137e130c0b0e220aa039c429e2e6fea2df185011b65e" :answer/id #uuid "03523142-f6c3-5749-8915-f4be6e63e2c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+15x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107540/selection/4a45ec1a0c495997f621abe996d6cbc64855a925f5d8549efcf4be4fd93454b8" :answer/id #uuid "a0f4cf92-b55b-5d11-9655-297a72d2ca0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+60x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107540/selection/799b766749fd2a8def316366732363c914f5b8edbd918ede8dcdd463677db590" :answer/id #uu