estion/math-academy-id "q-316630" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=0,$ ${x}_{2}=-4,$ and ${x}_{3}=7,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $-5.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,+$\n{{field-3}}$x$" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=0,$ ${x}_{2}=-4,$ and ${x}_{3}=7,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=-5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =-5(x-0)(x-(-4))(x-7) \\\\  & =-5\\,x\\,(x+4)(x-7)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\,x\\,(x+4)(x-7) & =-5\\,x\\,({x}^{2}-3x-28) \\\\  & =-5({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}-28x) \\\\  & =-5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+140x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+140x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316630/field-1" "q-316630/field-2" "q-316630/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316630"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-104489/selection/d5b0adabf5e706161ccb24c8d5f04d2b4ccd1032f351f674c0344053091787a6" :answer/id #uuid "4966277c-50e9-5723-909a-f77ecee246e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-4x+10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104489/selection/78c9a5e9d3af9bf4883143fc5b33c8b616f5532cc981929218dd5cfbb9aa99e4" :answer/id #uuid "43d6ed9e-848a-5fd1-bcb4-6ae1b774f1ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x-20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104489/selection/7c716be6169647801798bf8e87b8dfaf4fd0df13fb680ea0fbd29732c913f584" :answer/id #uuid "7d0741fd-6970-52b4-95a4-fb9bbe6b628d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104489/selection/201f279add778e71c6fc0001f4a942c1575d9ca4d35e6ab0d90